  "all_ingredients_flat": "1/2 lbs white peas, 1/2 tsp Kala Chaat Masala, 1/2 tsp Yellow Chaat Masala, 1/2 tsp kala namak (black salt; to taste), 1 cucumber — chopped, 1 onion — chopped, 1-2 tomatoes — chopped, 1 jalapeños — minced, 1/2 cup thick tamarind water (add more according to your taste), 1/2 cup chopped coriander, 1/4 cup Green Chutney (optional), 1/4 cup Date Chutney (optional), lettuce (optional)",
  "instructions": "• Boil 1/2 lb white peas in Instant Pot at high pressure for 10 to 12 minutes.Water should be double the peas by volume.\n• Add tamarind water, Chaat Masalas and black salt (kala namak — to taste).\n• Add all the chopped vegetables if you want to eat it immediately. If not, add them when serving.\n• Optionally add some lettuce, Green Chutney and Date Chutney for enhanced Chaat flavor.\n• Serve hot or cold with Whole Wheat Pita Bread or Ezekiel 4:9 Bread.",
  "cooking_methods": [
    "boil",
